FOCAL
OMSI FOCAL MANUAL
STARTUP OPTIONS:
0	NO FEATURES
1	SIN & COS
2	SIN COS & TAN
3	10 DIGITS
4	FILE COMMANDS
5	SPACE IN TYPE
6	=
7	:
8	& INSTEAD OF E
9	2+3+4

'YES'=2+3+4+5

STANDARD WITH STAT USE 4+5.
