FORTRAN.HL

MANUAL OS/8 HANDBOOK CHAPTER 8.

.EX PROG		(.FT,.RL,OR .LD)
.EX PROG1,PROG2		(ONLY .RL)
*FILES			(ACCORDING TO DESCRIPTION)
*$			(ALTMODE)

COMPILING ETC (SHORT SUMMARY)

.EXEC [LIST.LS,LOADIM.LD,MAP.LS<]SOURCE.FT...
.COMP SOURCE[-T;-L]

COMPILER
/M	ONLY LIST LINES WITH ERROR
/N	NO LINE NUMBERS
/A	NO ASSEMBLY

	RALF ASSEMBLER
/L	LOAD
/G	LOAD AND CALL FRTS	ALTMODE=NO DEV SPEC
	LOAD
/G	LOAD FINISHED
	FRTS
/#	DEVICES
/C	CARRIAGE CONTROL
