SABR
SABR IS NOT A SYSTEM PROGRAM
MANUAL OS/8 HANDBOOK CHAPTER 4
.R SABR
*BINARY.RL,LISTNG.LS,MAP.MP<FILE.SB,...

/F	INPUT IS FROM FORT
/G	CHAIN TO LOADER AND GO
/L	CHAIN TO LOADER
/N	NO LISTING
/S	NO SYMBOL TABLE

ERRORS:

A	WRONG NO. OF ARG'S
C	BAD CHAR
D	I/O ERROR
E	NO END STMNT
I	ILLEGAL SYNTAX
L	SYS:LOADER.SV NOT FOUND
M	MULTIPLY DEFINED SYMBOL
S	SYMBOL OVERFLOW
U	UNDEFINED SYMBOL
